     "titulo": "As if",
     "texto": [
      "**Come se** + imperfect subjunctive: **Parla come se sapesse tutto** (he talks as if he knew everything).",
      "It describes a comparison that is not real."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Mixed",
     "texto": [
      "**Se fossi partito ieri, ora sarei lì** (if I had left yesterday, I would be there now).",
      "The condition and the result share the same implied subject; the condition is in the past and the result is in the present."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
